\ h5raw ( blk st k s -- )  the compression, raw: the block at blk into the
\ state at st, with the constants at k and the scratch at s (0x7C4
\ bytes).  From tools/gensha512.py through tools/asm2fam.py; the fam
\ words above (hS0 ...) are what it does, kept for reading.
