;
\ h5blk ( blk -- )  one 128-byte block into the state.
: h5blk  h5st @ h5k @ h5ws @ h5raw ;

\ h5go ( src len pre -- )  len bytes at src into the state, then the
\ padding (pre bytes went before them); the digest at h5d.
: h5go
h5t !  dup h5t @ + h5t !  h5n !
begin h5n @ 80 lit u< 0= while dup h5blk 80 lit +  h5n @ 80 lit - h5n ! repeat
h5b @ 100 lit 0 lit do 0 lit over i + c! loop drop
h5b @ h5n @ h5bc
80 lit h5b @ h5n @ + c!
h5n @ 11 lit + 80 lit u> if 100 lit else 80 lit then
h5t @ 1D lit rshift  over 8 lit - h5b @ + h5be!
h5t @ 3 lit lshift  over 4 lit - h5b @ + h5be!
h5b @ h5blk  100 lit = if h5b @ 80 lit + h5blk then
8 lit 0 lit do i 3 lit lshift h5st @ + @64  i 3 lit lshift h5d @ + tuck 4 lit + h5be! h5be! loop ;
: h5iv  h5iv0 @ h5st @ 10 lit h5wc ;
: sha512  h5init h5iv 0 lit h5go ;

\ h5key ( key klen -- )  HMAC's two pad states for this key, kept.
: h5key
h5init
dup 80 lit u> if sha512  h5d @ 40 lit else then  h5pn ! h5pp !
h5kb @ 80 lit 0 lit do 0 lit over i + c! loop drop
h5pp @ h5kb @ h5pn @ h5bc
h5iv  80 lit 0 lit do h5kb @ i + c@ 36 lit xor h5b @ i + c! loop  h5b @ h5blk  h5st @ h5ip @ 10 lit h5wc
h5iv  80 lit 0 lit do h5kb @ i + c@ 5C lit xor h5b @ i + c! loop  h5b @ h5blk  h5st @ h5op @ 10 lit h5wc ;
\ h5mac ( msg mlen -- )  HMAC of the message under the key h5key took.
: h5mac
h5ip @ h5st @ 10 lit h5wc  80 lit h5go
h5d @ h5u @ 40 lit h5bc  h5op @ h5st @ 10 lit h5wc  h5u @ 40 lit 80 lit h5go ;
: hmac512  h5mn ! h5ma !  h5key  h5ma @ h5mn @ h5mac ;
: pbkdf512
h5on ! h5o !  h5it !  h5mn ! h5ma !  h5key
\ U1 = HMAC(P, S || 1)
h5ma @ h5sb @ h5mn @ h5bc  0 lit h5sb @ h5mn @ + h5be! 1 lit h5sb @ h5mn @ + 3 lit + c!
h5sb @ h5mn @ 4 lit + h5mac
h5d @ h5x @ 40 lit h5bc
h5it @ 1 lit u> if h5it @ 1 lit do
	h5d @ h5sb @ 40 lit h5bc  h5sb @ 40 lit h5mac
	40 lit 0 lit do h5x @ i + dup c@ h5d @ i + c@ xor swap c! loop
loop then
h5x @ h5o @ h5on @ h5bc ;
